---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { AREAS } from '../lib/areas';
import { waLink } from '../lib/site';
import { LEAD_CAPTURE } from '../lib/golive';
---
<Base title="Buy UAE Property" description="Find and buy the right property in the UAE (ready or off-plan) with personal guidance from selection through DLD registration.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Buy</p>
      <h1 style="max-width:18ch">Find the right property. <em>Not just any property.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">Whether it's your first home in the UAE or your next one, I shortlist based on your actual brief (budget, community, lifestyle, and what you plan to do with the property), not what's easiest to sell.</p>

      <div class="card empty" style="margin-top:var(--space-12)">
        <p>No live sale listings yet. Real listings, photos and compliance data are being added as they come in.</p>
        {LEAD_CAPTURE && (
          <div class="actions" style="justify-content:center">
            <a class="btn" href="/contact?intent=buy">Tell me what you're looking for</a>
            <a class="btn btn--ghost" href={waLink("Hi Sharjeel, I'd like to discuss buying a property in the UAE.")} target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp me instead →</a>
          </div>
        )}
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid--2" style="margin-top:var(--space-12)">
        <div class="card">
          <h2>Ready Properties</h2>
          <p>Move-in ready units, personally vetted: the building, the floor plan, the view, the numbers.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h2>Off-Plan Properties</h2>
          <p>New launches from major developers, reviewed for payment structure, handover timeline and developer track record. See <a href="/new-launches">New Launches</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card" style="margin-top:var(--space-6)">
        <p class="kicker" style="margin:0">Areas I cover</p>
        <ul class="list-plain">
          {AREAS.map((a) => <li><a href={`/areas/${a.slug}`}>{a.name}</a></li>)}
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:var(--space-12);padding-top:var(--space-8);border-top:1px solid var(--line)">
        <h2 style="font-size:var(--fs-heading);line-height:var(--lh-heading)">Buying in the UAE from abroad</h2>
        <p class="lede" style="font-size:var(--fs-body)">You don't need to be in the UAE to buy well here. Briefing → virtual shortlist → remote viewings → due diligence → negotiation → transaction coordination → handover or leasing, managed on your behalf from wherever you are.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
